("identity.dad", "mapTitle", "A map for the everyday work of care.")
("identity.dad", "mapCopy", "Start with listening, make room for another person, and leave a route back after getting something wrong. Follow the small choices that shape a home.")
("identity.dad", "atlasCardCopy", "Find presence, care and a way back.")
("identity.dad", "readingPrompt", "As Dad, ask what presence would look like here, whose room to grow matters, and what a patient act of repair might require.")
