("identity.christian", "threadsTitle", "Faith, with open hands.")
("identity.christian", "threadsCopy", "How should I understand God, Jesus, the Bible and other religions? Begin with a personal Christian reading, then follow it into service, hope and ordinary life.")
("identity.christian", "threadsCardCopy", "Follow grace, hope and service.")
("identity.christian", "mapTitle", "A map for faith lived among people.")
("identity.christian", "mapCopy", "Begin with hope, attend to a neighbour, and question what power is serving. The readings retain their own sources and limits; this lens does not turn an analogy into evidence.")
("identity.christian", "atlasCardCopy", "Explore hope, service and shared life.")
("identity.christian", "readingPrompt", "As a Christian, ask how love of God and neighbour meets this question, what power should relinquish, and what hope asks you to practise.")
